UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|It turns out we could defend better, as we could possibly take a diamond and a club. However, although given the lead, East played the hand correctly because the hearts are onside, declarer might be able to avoid losing a second heart by finessing North for the @HQ.

|
