cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|East |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=declarerpoints,Bergen Declarer Points^*N|CP||FP||at| are 5 HCP, -1 for doubleton @HQ, +1 length point, +1 point for 2 doubletons, and +1 point for side 4+ card club suit for 7 points. Normally, I would say East should bid 4@S as East is at the top of 1@S range (8 or less). However, the @CK is very dubious as is the club length. So I think pass is best.|
