UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|The hand is tough to play. An alternative line is, after winning the first spade cash the @DA and @DK and try and ruff a diamond. If they are 3-3 the diamonds are set up. If they are not 3-3 and South happens to have four then North will have to ruff with the Jack or can be overruffed. That might save a trick.

|
