nt|^z@3^b@2^^|
pc|C3|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|A club lead is fine and many players would lead that. However, in general when you have a choice of leads in NT you tend to favor leading a major which speaks to leading a spade here. But many do not like to lead away from AQ, in this hand. I don't happen to agree with that and I would have led a spade particularly in IMPs. Further, I am a big believer in ^*B4th. from your Longest and Strongest^*n.|
PG| ***** 64 ***** |


sk|S|pc|C5|pc|C6|pc|CT|

nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I have 3 diamond and 3 club tricks for sure. I should be able to manage a trick in one of the majors.|
PG| ***** 65 ***** |


