UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Declarer took a very nice line. Well done West. As it turns out, we could cash our two aces and hold them to 5 but the heart was still the best lead. On a good day I would have the @HA and we would beat the hand.|
PG| ***** 97 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|In 5@S we lose one spade, one club, and one heart for down one. So it turns out better than their making 5@C. However, 5 level decisions are among the hardest in bridge as ^*BThe 5 level belongs to the opponents is good advice.^*n

|
PG| ***** 98 ***** |


